Sharks exist, but they rarely attack humans. Most sharks are afraid of humans and move away.
Saltwater crocodiles do not actively live in the ocean; their primary habitat is the river delta in northern Rockhampton.
Booking in advance gives travelers peace of mind that they will have a place to stay when they arrive at their destination.
Travel agencies often have contracts with specific hotels; although, through a travel agency, you may also be able to find other types of accommodation, such as camping sites.
Travel agencies typically offer packages that include breakfast, airport transfer arrangements, or even combined flight and hotel packages.
They can also reserve time for you if you need additional time to consider a proposal or prepare other documents for your destination (such as a visa).
Therefore, any amendment or request must be made through the travel agency agent and not directly through the hotel.
