Culture shock appears earlier than reverse culture shock (it occurs earlier than the honeymoon phase), lasts longer, and can be more intense.
Travelers who have easily adapted to the new culture sometimes find it very difficult to return to their native culture.
Upon returning home after living abroad, you have adopted a new culture and have lost some of your habits from your native culture.
